OL,3,GNEWSAPoll observers urge tighter rules
OL,4,Aon Value Jersey
OL,5,
OL,6,FInternational election observers have
OL,7,Fcalled for Jersey to tighten its
OL,8,Fcampaign finance rules after concerns
OL,9,Fduring the 2026 election about the role
OL,10,Fand funding of political movement Value
OL,11,FJersey.
OL,13,FA report by the Commonwealth
OL,14,FParliamentary Association's Election
OL,15,FObservation Mission said there needed
OL,16,Fto be greater transparency around
OL,17,Fpolitical finances.
OL,19,FThe mission said Jersey should consider
OL,20,Fmaking candidates, political parties
OL,21,Fand movements disclose donations and
OL,22,Fspending.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
